  "limitations": [
    "Static source2025 to target2026 carryforward evidence only; do not generalize to every source year or slip type.",
    "The supplied CIL and fresh REA metadata pin the mapping methods; BAML-derived XAML links target money indexes to box labels. No source values were read or converted.",
    "Source raw Q-field member semantics and the money/list accessor implementations still require a bounded review before normalization.",
    "A preferred view is not proof of an economic slip: empty/cached views and repeated copies across return years must retain provenance and must not be blindly summed or deduplicated.",
    "T4 second CPP/QPP contributions and other target fields not written by the carryforward are listed as unmapped; absence of assignment is not proof the source lacks them.",
    "T5 dividend tax credits and other calculated values must not be invented from partial carryforward fields.",
    "Province, allocation, issuer parsing and additive expressions require explicit handling; copied numeric IDs alone are insufficient for full conversion.",
    "This report does not approve tax figures, create tax cases, post accounting entries, file returns, or mark the whole native-slip gap closed."
  ]
